Subject: link a JSX closing tag back to its opening tag

Issue: ubugeeei-prod/uf#1381
Upstream: not filed yet
Submodule: 81b0c2a3dd591c66c51167aac341d851932bd9c5

`get_linked_locs` returned the opening and closing names only when the
cursor was in the opening name. A cursor in the closing name found nothing,
so linked editing could not rename a tag from its close. Both names match.

diff --git a/rust_port/crates/flow_services_jsx/src/linked_editing_jsx.rs b/rust_port/crates/flow_services_jsx/src/linked_editing_jsx.rs
